{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/relive' data-target='computer\/program\/relive' data-title='Relive'>\r\n\t\t\tRelive\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Issue: Hotkey not working, Cause, Solution, No audio, and Solution.","label":"Issue","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Hotkey not working<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHotkeys do not work.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Cause<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tProgram does not work with virtualization enabled.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Solution<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDisable virtualization in BIOS.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t(Previously had worked with disabling HyperV; but not anymore with Windows 10 Preview build 1607 and AMD 17.2.1).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>No audio<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo audio is recorded.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Solution<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSelect \u201cwhat you hear\u201d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCheck audio bit rate.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Creative X-Fi sound card.<\/strong> Select \u201cAudio creation\u201d mode.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/relive\/issue\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/relive\/issue\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/relive' data-target='computer\/program\/relive' data-title='Relive'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Relive<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}